Package: raterevision
Title: Insurance Rate Revision Workflow Tools
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Greg", "Sollenberger", email = "yagreg7@yahoo.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Provides tools for insurance rate revision workflows around normalized
    rating factor tables. Functions reshape long-form rating tables into
    actuary-friendly wide tables, round-trip those tables through Microsoft Excel,
    apply and review proposed factor changes, rebase and normalize relativities,
    compare current and proposed rating output, summarize rate impacts, and solve
    a one-dimensional rate-level adjustment to meet a target aggregate rate change.
    The package is designed to work naturally with 'ratingtables' while remaining
    usable with ordinary data frames and arbitrary user-supplied rating code.
